<title>USA: Modern Controls to continue buying stock.</title>
<headline>Modern Controls to continue buying stock.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Modern Controls Inc said Thursday that authorization to repurchase shares of its common stock has been continued by its board of directors.</p>
<p>Repurchases will be made on the open market at prices not exceeding the market price. The number of shares was not specified.</p>
<p>At September 30, the instrumentation company had 4.3 million average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
